---
kind: scene
id: isles.coralCave
title: The Coralreach sea cave
on: enterPlace
target: place.coralCave
once: false
when: "@islesLowTide && !holds('islesLensBack', ['coralreach'])"
---

// AREA isles: the sea cave is walkable only at low tide (mornings). High tide
// is an entry in lore/isles/islands.lute.

## The tide pools

::bg{location="coral-cave" time="morning"}
@narrator: At low tide the cave floor is a path of wet coral. At the far end a grunt is up to her knees in a pool, the Coralreach lens under one arm.
::use{component="trainerBattle" who="duskGruntBrine" intro="The tide comes back in an hour. So do you, if you stay." win="Take it, before we both drown." lose="Tide's turning!" prize="1800"}
::assert{islesLensBack(coralreach) when="@wonFight"}
